Scoped shuffleplanes video filter

The option table, the format rule and the plane remapping in
src/video-ops/shuffleplanes.ts follow libavfilter/vf_shuffleplanes.c
(shuffleplanes_options, query_formats, shuffleplanes_config_input and
shuffleplanes_filter_frame, including the av_frame_copy made for duplicated maps).
